{
 "section_summary": "This section continues a numbered monthly news digest on wartime economic, industrial, agricultural, communications and administrative developments in Japan and Japanese-occupied Asia during July 1943. It reports resource mobilization in Japan and Manchuria, infrastructure and economic controls in occupied China, transfers of concessions and enemy assets to the Nanking regime, industrial rehabilitation in Hong Kong, and restored communications and transport in the Philippines. Most items are attributed to Domei, with additional reports from the Central News Agency and Chunghua News Agency.",
